WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
Reach into the music.
Grab a sound. Pull back. Let go.

00:08.000 --> 00:15.000
Every shape carries a sound.
Independent musical patterns, pulled into orbit.

00:15.000 --> 00:22.000
The cello is the center.
The other performers move around it, each in their own time.

00:22.000 --> 00:31.000
Move through the music.
Two hands change where you listen.

00:31.000 --> 00:39.000
Hear it from inside the orbit.
Grab a performer to follow its journey.

00:39.000 --> 00:47.000
One composition. Two worlds.
Point to both sides: Celestial becomes Atomic.

00:47.000 --> 00:54.000
Astra opened a new creative door.
Music × Blender × hand tracking × spatial audio.

00:54.000 --> 01:00.000
Gravity.
Reach into the music.
